# Time Coverage at a Glance

| Run | Start | End | Years |
|---|---|---|---|
| Historical (PNWNAmet) | 1945 | 2012 | 68 |
| CanESM2 RCP 4.5 | 1945 | 2099 | 155 |
| CanESM2 RCP 8.5 | 1945 | 2099 | 155 |

So for each station/grid-cell we have up to **155 years × 365 days ≈ 56,575 daily values** per scenario per variable.

The processing code (file lists, 5×5 mapping, top-9 representative value, block-maxima, GEV merge) is documented separately in the workflow Rmd.
